---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<SiteLayout title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`} active="about">
	<h1 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">About Me</h1>
	<article class="prose prose-invert prose-gray max-w-none">
		<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-300">
			Hello, I’m Zehao Yu, an undergraduate student at The Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen, majoring in Pure Mathematics and minoring in Philosophy.
		</p>
		<p>
			I’m drawn to the precision of mathematics and to the broader questions it raises about knowledge, structure, and the limits of understanding. My current interests include Lie theory and algebraic number theory, and I hope to explore more connections between abstract algebra, geometry, and number theory.
		</p>
		<p>
			My path in mathematics has included difficult challenges and steady growth. I’ve learned to approach demanding problems with patience, curiosity, and a willingness to keep going when the answer is not immediately clear. Outside my studies, I enjoy playing basketball, reading, and having thoughtful conversations about mathematics, philosophy, and literature.
		</p>
		<p>
			This website is a place for me to share what I’m learning through notes, projects, and writing.
		</p>
	</article>

	<section class="mt-12">
		<h2 class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-200">Find me online</h2>
		<div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
			<a href="https://github.com/interstellartrek" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="group rounded-lg border border-gray-800 p-5 transition hover:border-gray-600 hover:bg-white/[0.03]">
				<span class="font-medium text-gray-200 transition group-hover:text-white">GitHub</span>
				<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">Projects and code</p>
			</a>
			<a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1539807661?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="group rounded-lg border border-gray-800 p-5 transition hover:border-gray-600 hover:bg-white/[0.03]">
				<span class="font-medium text-gray-200 transition group-hover:text-white">Bilibili</span>
				<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">Videos and updates</p>
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-12">
		<h2 class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-200">Email</h2>
		<div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
			<div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-800 p-5">
				<h3 class="font-medium text-gray-200">Work</h3>
				<div class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
					<p><a href="mailto:zehaoyu@link.cuhk.edu.cn" class="text-gray-400 transition hover:text-white">zehaoyu@link.cuhk.edu.cn</a> <span class="text-gray-600">· CUHK-Shenzhen</span></p>
					<p><a href="mailto:zehaoyu@berkeley.edu" class="text-gray-400 transition hover:text-white">zehaoyu@berkeley.edu</a> <span class="text-gray-600">· Berkeley</span></p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-800 p-5">
				<h3 class="font-medium text-gray-200">Personal</h3>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm"><a href="mailto:interstellartrek@outlook.com" class="text-gray-400 transition hover:text-white">interstellartrek@outlook.com</a></p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</SiteLayout>
